cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or refer to these results, please cite the paper below."
title: "Encoder study of peak-level tandem mass spectra"
abstract: >-
  Code and analysis supporting a controlled measurement of the cost of binning
  tandem mass spectra for substructure prediction. Replacing a 0.5 Da binned
  intensity vector with a full-precision peak set raises macro AUPRC from 0.0476
  to 0.1119 on 8,692 held-out molecules.
